/generate_audit.py

# #222: intel.dat is fully regenerated by refresh_intel.sh on every run (now
# every 6h via the intel-refresh systemd timer) — merged live-feed output,
# not a deliverable. A prior manual run got swept into git by an unrelated
# commit; untracked here so the scheduled refresh doesn't leave a permanent
# uncommitted diff. intel.seed.dat (the curated, deterministic source) stays
# tracked. #270: moved to its own data/ subdirectory, separate from
# config.zeek/refresh_intel.sh (code) — see configs/systemd/
# intel-refresh.service's ReadWritePaths comment.
configs/intel/data/intel.dat
